### Crash Configurations Validated

| Compiler Flags | GC Trigger | Result |
|---|---|---|
| `--wasm-compiler=optimizing` | `minorgc()` (shell) | SIGSEGV (139) |
| `--wasm-compiler=optimizing --test-wasm-await-tier2` | JS alloc pressure | SIGSEGV (139) |
